Expanded billing meter schema for millisecond, input image and cached token usage.
Migrated storyboard identity and position.
✔ billing settles real provider usage above the authorization when the released balance covers it (332.7703ms)
✔ a released authorization cannot settle a late provider result or reduce other frozen funds (330.2548ms)
✔ usage summary keeps project attribution as an authorization-time snapshot and separates unassigned history (425.5702ms)
✔ project snapshot backfill only restores an unambiguous owned generation (304.02ms)
✔ billing keeps the authorization frozen for reconciliation when actual usage exceeds releasable balance (260.1734ms)
✔ an administrator can collect a historical capped-settlement difference exactly once (364.0729ms)
✔ bulk historical settlement repair collects every eligible user and reports insufficient balances (472.9627ms)
✔ setting a balance targets the requested amount instead of adding to it (422.9251ms)
✔ admin grants are additive and idempotent while lifetime consumption remains independent (306.9628ms)
✔ billing, usage, and audit logs expose stable server-side pagination (331.2208ms)
✔ expired reconciliation releases the frozen authorization and leaves an audit trail (720.6248ms)
✔ the operations console settles and waives pending cases from the paged projection (404.9086ms)
✔ three pending reconciliations for one model rate-limit later calls (247.203ms)
✔ passwords have no format rule beyond being non-empty (356.6897ms)
✔ self registration creates a normal user and an authenticated session (387.186ms)
✔ a user can change a unique username and receives a session for the new identity (411.7645ms)
✔ published price books require explicit, positive or free prices (388.007ms)
✔ conditional video token rates use integer points with no floating point drift (315.1266ms)
✔ conditional video rates prefer the most specific matching rule and reject ambiguity (473.1653ms)
✔ token price tiers use only canonical usage and reject uncovered ranges (950.5769ms)
✔ micro-points preserve a non-zero charge for low token usage (2106.4256ms)
✔ billing precision migration is idempotent after the ledger is converted (3601.0674ms)
✔ creator model list never exposes provider credentials (1465.6314ms)
